{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31563","headline":"龟 · 李羣玉","name":"龟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静养千年寿，重泉自隐居。\n不应随跛鼈，宁肯滞凡鱼。\n灵腹唯玄露，芳巢必翠蕖。\n扬花输蚌蛤，犇月恨蟾蜍。\n曳尾辞泥後，支牀得水初。\n冠山期不小，铸印事宁虚。\n有志酬毛宝，无心畏豫且。\n他时清洛汭，会荐帝尧书。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31563.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31563","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}